    "description": {
      "en": "Original low-poly direction: establish annulated stout tube with a hooked retractile proboscis and small rear anchor hooks in the blockout, then preserve the largest silhouette breaks and openings. Simplify fine ornament and repeated elements without copying reference meshes; palette and presentation are artistic choices, not fossil evidence.",
