    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism teaching interpretation: one curved annulated soft trunk with graded thickness, a short conservative introvert and inset mouth cup, plus a few restrained posterior hook hints. Muted colors, nominal0.1m body length and static curvature are artistic choices. No mechanical stacked cylinders, exact microscopic hook/tooth counts, fully exposed tooth array, feeding scene or detailed soft-anatomy/locomotor claim. Closed introvert roots overlap organically within the trunk.",
      "zh": "原创全体教学生活复原：连续柔弯环纹躯体与渐变粗细、短而保守的可缩吻端及内凹口杯，辅以少量克制后钩提示。柔和颜色、0.1米名义体长及静态弯曲为美术设定。不堆叠机械圆筒，不主张精确微钩/齿数，不展示满口尖牙、捕食场景或详细软组织/运动机制。封闭吻根自然嵌接于躯体。"
    },
